 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "emerald",
   "title": "The contract",
   "items": [
    "Events are past-tense facts; a request with one owner stays a typed command",
    "An event emitted while draining goes to the tail of the same drain, generation + 1, with caps",
    "Handlers never call handlers; they get the event, their query ports, an emitter and their own state"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Persistence",
   "items": [
    "The queue is empty at every tick's end: it is in neither the state hash nor the save",
    "The timer heap is the one new save section",
    "The event log is derived; replay input stays the save, the seed and the command stream"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "slate",
   "title": "Evidence",
